<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Login Admin - TIK Universitas</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-[#fafafa] min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-6 text-[#262626]">
    
    <div class="max-w-md w-full bg-white border border-[#d9d9d9] rounded-2xl shadow-xl p-8 relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-2 bg-[#e62129]"></div>

        <div class="text-center mb-8">
            <div class="mx-auto flex items-center justify-center h-16 w-16 rounded-full bg-gray-100 mb-4 border border-gray-200">
                <svg class="h-8 w-8 text-[#262626]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z" />
                </svg>
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#e62129]">Otorisasi Admin</h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#595959] mt-2">
                Selamat datang, <span class="font-semibold text-[#262626]"><%= admin.nama %></span>. Silakan masukkan kata sandi Anda untuk melanjutkan.
            </p>
        </div>

        <form action="/verifikasi-admin" method="POST" class="space-y-5">
            <input type="hidden" name="nip" value="<%= admin.nip %>">

            <div>
                <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-[#262626] mb-1">Kata Sandi</label>
                <input type="password" name="password" required autofocus
                    class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border border-[#d9d9d9] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#e62129]/30 focus:border-[#e62129] transition-all text-sm"
                    placeholder="••••••••">
                
                <% if (typeof error !== 'undefined' && error) { %>
                    <p class="text-xs text-red-500 mt-2 font-medium"><%= error %></p>
                <% } %>
            </div>

            <div class="pt-2 space-y-3">
                <button type="submit" 
                    class="w-full flex justify-center py-3 px-4 border border-transparent rounded-lg shadow-sm text-sm font-bold text-white bg-[#e62129] hover:bg-[#ca161c] focus:outline-none transition-colors uppercase tracking-wide">
                    Masuk Dashboard
                </button>
                
                <a href="/" 
                    class="w-full flex justify-center py-3 px-4 border border-[#d9d9d9] rounded-lg shadow-sm text-sm font-bold text-[#595959] bg-white hover:bg-gray-50 focus:outline-none transition-colors uppercase tracking-wide">
                    Batal
                </a>
            </div>
        </form>

    </div>

</body>
</html>